      <title>What Are Flock Cameras? Why Are They So Controversial?</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-18/what-are-flock-cameras-why-are-they-so-controversial</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f1c1abe841a0951cc48b29b1</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 14:39:48 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Thousands of US cities and towns have installed surveillance tools made by Flock Safety, a fast-growing Atlanta startup. The connected devices, such as sensors and automated license plate readers, have allowed law-enforcement agencies to map vehicles’ travel over long distances, which, they say, bolsters their ability to fight crime. But critics contend the network of cameras amounts to mass surveillance.</description>
